# MISC-MH-11: flatten -doproperty: a kept instance (keep, hint K) and a flattened one (fl, hint F, with a flattened leaf, hint X): Magic copies only K, Hefesto F and X as well (Q-MISC-15).
# Hefesto script (hefesto-cli --diagnostics=magic): the same commands.
tech load input/t -noprompt
snap internal
drc off
load leaf
box 0 0 4 4
paint m1
property MASKHINTS_X 0 0 2 2
property flatten true
save leaf
load keep
box 0 0 4 4
paint m1
property MASKHINTS_K 0 0 2 2
save keep
load fl
box 0 0 4 4
paint m1
property MASKHINTS_F 0 0 3 3
property flatten true
box 6 0 6 0
getcell leaf
save fl
load top
box 0 0 4 4
paint m1
box 20 0 20 0
getcell keep
box 40 0 40 0
getcell fl
save top
load top
flatten -doproperty flat
load flat
save flat
property MASKHINTS_K
property MASKHINTS_F
property MASKHINTS_X
